WEBVTT

NOTE Captions for t3-02-conflict-navigation.mp3 — machine-transcribed on-device from the existing audio (SR-472). Not proofread.
NOTE Cues with ids phase-recognise/-regulate/-release/-rise mark where each step begins; js/saferise-poster.js reads them.

00:00:02.170 --> 00:00:04.670
There is someone you have to keep working with.

00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:15.210
That is what makes this specific friction so exhausting.

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:17.400
You cannot simply walk away

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:19.240
And you cannot burn it down.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:23.620
Because on Monday morning you both still share the same environment.

00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:33.040
Nothing in this practice is going to decide who is right.

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:40.910
That is a real question.

00:00:41.260 --> 00:00:44.290
But it isn't the one we can influence right now.

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:54.330
The physical armor locks into place instantly.

00:00:54.610 --> 00:00:58.070
While the season professional who knows how to navigate this,

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:00.100
Takes longer to take the wheel

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:09.790
The real drain happens in the war between those two speeds.

00:01:15.760 --> 00:01:20.820
Carrying a burning coal with the intent to throw it only sears your own hand.

00:01:21.270 --> 00:01:22.570
You can keep the grievance.

00:01:22.960 --> 00:01:24.730
We are going to put the coal down

00:01:25.030 --> 00:01:26.330
Four clear phases.

00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:28.050
Let's move through them

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:30.250
Step by step, recognise.

00:01:30.640 --> 00:01:34.470
Identify where this specific conflict lives in your body.

00:01:34.770 --> 00:01:37.890
Notice the clenched jaw, the height shoulders.

00:01:38.140 --> 00:01:46.890
The sudden tightness across your chest when their name appears in an inbox or
the sinking sensation in your stomach before a shared meeting.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:56.750
Give this physical state a single word

00:01:57.020 --> 00:01:59.580
Agitated, stay with it for a moment.

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:01.330
Don't move past it yet.

00:02:01.670 --> 00:02:04.090
Notice exactly what that word excludes.

00:02:04.320 --> 00:02:12.920
It leaves out the other person what they said in March, their management style
and their flaws. None of that history is in dispute.

00:02:13.220 --> 00:02:21.440
It is just that their behavior is entirely out of your reach, while the
tension in your jaw belongs to you. Now go one layer deeper.

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:32.430
Beneath the frustration is the trap sensation of being stuck with them.

00:02:32.670 --> 00:02:36.820
No exit door, no ultimate referee to declare you the winner.

00:02:37.330 --> 00:02:39.210
Stay there for one full breath.

00:02:45.480 --> 00:02:47.570
That trapped feeling is the real weight.

00:02:47.900 --> 00:02:48.860
Not the person.

00:02:55.040 --> 00:02:56.720
One layer further down.

00:03:03.840 --> 00:03:06.570
Look closely at the primary driver underneath.

00:03:06.930 --> 00:03:09.300
Losing agency in your own career.

00:03:09.610 --> 00:03:15.260
Being isolated on an island while they win the team, absorbing the blame for
their friction.

00:03:15.660 --> 00:03:18.410
Or running out of time to do your actual work.

00:03:18.720 --> 00:03:21.050
Notice which one landed closest.

00:03:21.650 --> 00:03:24.020
Think into that core vulnerability.

00:03:24.410 --> 00:03:25.950
Leave it right where it is.

00:03:26.450 --> 00:03:28.390
Nothing needs to be solved here.

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:29.370
Regulate

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:38.840
Now we soften the physical bracing so you can think clearly.

00:03:39.210 --> 00:03:41.920
Starting in the exact places you just found

00:03:42.190 --> 00:03:44.800
Draw a slow breath in for four counts

00:03:45.050 --> 00:03:46.840
And release it for six counts.

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:55.780
Keep the exhale longer than the inhale.

00:03:56.120 --> 00:03:57.600
10 seconds of cycle

00:04:02.780 --> 00:04:07.040
That is the pace your heart rhythm settles into when it is given the chance.

00:04:13.400 --> 00:04:16.470
Drop your shoulders an inch and cleanse your teeth.

00:04:22.010 --> 00:04:24.480
Let your tongue come off the roof of your mouth.

00:04:30.730 --> 00:04:32.750
Now that tightness across the chest,

00:04:33.130 --> 00:04:34.290
Let it go slack.

00:04:34.620 --> 00:04:36.170
And let your stomach soften.

00:04:36.530 --> 00:04:39.830
A braised stomach keeps the whole system on alert.

00:04:40.310 --> 00:04:43.120
And it is the last place anyone thinks to check

00:04:43.560 --> 00:04:44.640
Your hands too

00:04:50.920 --> 00:05:00.658
If they are gripping anything, open them, spread the fingers, then let them
drop loose. This adjustment works at a desk in an elevator or in the 10

00:05:00.658 --> 00:05:02.910
seconds before a zoom call begins.

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:05.000
No one can see you doing it.

00:05:05.550 --> 00:05:08.110
If you have a moment of privacy at this

00:05:08.390 --> 00:05:10.590
On your next out breath, come.

00:05:10.940 --> 00:05:12.280
Low and quiet

00:05:12.560 --> 00:05:15.290
Feel it vibrate through the chest and jaw

00:05:15.640 --> 00:05:17.750
The exact places that were clamped

00:05:18.070 --> 00:05:27.379
If you are not alone, just make the out breath long. The length is doing most
of the work. Come once more if you can and let it fade out rather than

00:05:27.379 --> 00:05:31.530
stopping it. Now bring your attention to the center of your chest.

00:05:31.900 --> 00:05:34.410
Then keep the breath moving through that point.

00:05:34.800 --> 00:05:44.770
In for 4, out for 6, and as you breathe there, bring to mind one thing you are
plainly glad of, from outside this entirely, not them.

00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:45.890
Not the work.

00:05:46.230 --> 00:05:47.940
A person a place

00:05:48.270 --> 00:05:51.030
Something that has nothing to do with any of this.

00:05:51.440 --> 00:05:59.460
Hold its steady at the chest while the breath passes through. This is the pot
that actually shifts the state. The rhythm settles the body.

00:05:59.710 --> 00:06:04.390
The warmth is what stops it rearming the moment you open your eyes.

00:06:11.270 --> 00:06:13.970
Thoughts of their incompetence will flare up

00:06:14.230 --> 00:06:24.303
Let each one arrive without pushing it away, agreeing with it, or following it
to its conclusion. A thought turning up is simply your ego cataloguing a

00:06:24.303 --> 00:06:24.770
threat.

00:06:25.060 --> 00:06:31.300
It is not a demand to go to war. If you notice yourself forcing relaxation,
ease off.

00:06:31.730 --> 00:06:40.410
Effort means you have just started fighting the tension instead of the person.
Smoke drifts through a hallway, but the walls do not catch fire.

00:06:47.360 --> 00:06:50.750
There are two parallel realities operating right now.

00:06:57.820 --> 00:07:00.460
First, there is the objective conflict.

00:07:00.710 --> 00:07:03.180
Which is real and likely ongoing.

00:07:09.050 --> 00:07:11.320
Second, there is the case.

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:15.800
The mental prosecution file your ego has meticulously assembled.

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:18.340
Complete with dates, slides,

00:07:18.550 --> 00:07:20.610
And out of context quotes

00:07:20.850 --> 00:07:24.190
Release, notice how the trial in your head is going.

00:07:24.520 --> 00:07:27.600
You are winning effortlessly, of course you are.

00:07:27.870 --> 00:07:31.590
The part of you acting as the lawyer is fiercely loyal to you.

00:07:31.910 --> 00:07:35.080
So it hands you a flawless victory every time.

00:07:40.650 --> 00:07:50.780
But here is the silent cost of carrying that file, a case that complete makes
ordinary collaboration impossible. When your nervous system is running a

00:07:50.780 --> 00:07:51.590
prosecution.

00:07:51.800 --> 00:07:59.570
Every neutral email, brief nod or quiet moment gets interpreted as fresh
evidence of their malice.

00:07:59.790 --> 00:08:00.960
That is the call.

00:08:07.900 --> 00:08:09.810
It is not hurting them at all.

00:08:16.210 --> 00:08:17.540
The conflict remains

00:08:17.770 --> 00:08:19.720
But you must put down the case file.

00:08:20.070 --> 00:08:21.050
Ask yourself

00:08:21.310 --> 00:08:23.940
What was this hyper vigilance built for?

00:08:33.320 --> 00:08:38.320
Something inside you went on high alert around this person and never stood
down.

00:08:38.680 --> 00:08:42.830
It tracks tone, stores details, and monitors alliances.

00:08:49.790 --> 00:08:51.370
That takes massive energy

00:08:51.640 --> 00:08:56.030
And it is what the ego does when it decides an environment isn't safe.

00:09:04.080 --> 00:09:05.630
Sit with that for a moment.

00:09:13.880 --> 00:09:16.280
The vigilance is not a character flaw.

00:09:21.970 --> 00:09:25.110
It is a system that read the room correctly once.

00:09:25.430 --> 00:09:27.390
And never got the signal to stop.

00:09:27.720 --> 00:09:29.850
You don't need to justify it now.

00:09:36.870 --> 00:09:39.510
And notice the harder truth underneath.

00:09:46.330 --> 00:09:52.370
A part of you does not want to put the file down because the file is proof
that you were wronged.

00:09:59.570 --> 00:10:02.300
Dropping it can feel like conceding the point

00:10:02.750 --> 00:10:03.530
Name that

00:10:03.820 --> 00:10:05.480
Rather than arguing with it.

00:10:12.430 --> 00:10:16.460
Putting the call down is not the same as saying nothing happened.

00:10:16.880 --> 00:10:20.550
It only means you stop holding the heat in your own hand.

00:10:26.600 --> 00:10:31.240
Put the underlying fear of being undermined where your breath is.

00:10:31.460 --> 00:10:33.240
And let it go out with the hum.

00:10:33.640 --> 00:10:42.210
Relentlessly defending your ego's pride will not change their character. None
of this gets settled from a state of hypervigilance.

00:10:42.670 --> 00:10:43.280
Rise

00:10:48.590 --> 00:10:52.730
Finally, we step into untouchable professional clarity.

00:10:53.100 --> 00:10:55.600
Visualize yourself from across the room.

00:10:55.960 --> 00:10:59.300
Placed in a working dynamic you did not choose

00:10:59.510 --> 00:11:01.170
You do not have to like them.

00:11:01.540 --> 00:11:04.470
You only have to be able to execute the work.

00:11:04.870 --> 00:11:10.570
Now, picture the version of yourself you want to embody in your next exchange
with them.

00:11:10.930 --> 00:11:15.210
Same underlying friction, same undeniable history.

00:11:22.150 --> 00:11:25.030
But you are the one deciding where your energy goes.

00:11:25.310 --> 00:11:28.050
Not improving your moral superiority

00:11:28.390 --> 00:11:31.760
But on moving the project forward, sevel and clear.

00:11:38.160 --> 00:11:39.270
Where are you sitting?

00:11:39.550 --> 00:11:41.980
What is the first objective thing you say?

00:11:49.420 --> 00:11:54.560
How steady does your voice sound when it is completely stripped of passive
aggression?

00:11:55.130 --> 00:11:57.700
Step directly into that quiet authority.

00:12:03.990 --> 00:12:10.240
The friction may still exist, but your attention belongs entirely to your own
standard of conduct.

00:12:15.820 --> 00:12:19.750
Pick one specific way you will hold your boundaries next time.

00:12:25.740 --> 00:12:26.600
Afterwards,

00:12:26.880 --> 00:12:28.340
Right down what shifted.

00:12:34.380 --> 00:12:36.370
Take one last slow breath

00:12:36.730 --> 00:12:38.980
In for four, an out for six.

00:12:39.200 --> 00:12:41.530
Let this one carry the harm if you can.

00:12:46.880 --> 00:12:49.090
Feel the solid floor supporting you.

00:12:49.460 --> 00:12:53.500
Roll your shoulders slowly, letting the tension in your neck loosen.

00:12:54.030 --> 00:12:55.360
Stretch your arms out

00:12:55.780 --> 00:12:57.990
And open your eyes when you are ready.

00:13:04.920 --> 00:13:10.700
Return to this anchor whenever you need to drop the prosecution and reclaim
your focus.

00:13:11.060 --> 00:13:12.440
Set the call down

00:13:12.710 --> 00:13:15.150
Your hand is the only one it was burning.
